  "human_scope_review": "Eight explicit owner-approved followups; independent stacked PR base #650 to avoid stale SQLCipher provider schema changes. All financial SQLCipher writer and authenticated source invariants; no unreviewed money writes and no changed approved UI geometry. Phone backup proof separate.",
  "user_requested_changes": [
    "Align projected balance and budget projection with verified total of all active SQLCipher bank accounts including opening balance, no forged balance when not verified.",
    "Reject bank/wallet child under mismatched or unknown selected provider before writer call in every inline account creation path including SMS transfers.",
    "Make creation of a bank/child with opening balance available through review SMS dropdown and separate transfer; refresh exact verified account witness after creation.",
    "Add two distinct opening balances persisted across SQLCipher reopen with no income posting, unit/UI source acceptance and release/QA documentation.",
    "M942 extend SQLCipher typed provider constraints and valid provider IDs to all approved Saudi local/digital banks and wallets. Upgrade legacy account-details v1 to v2 transactionally without altering opening_minor, account IDs, archived status or ledger.",
    "M942 align M447 SMS regression with new approved verified in-context first account creation while retaining mandatory account and no-shadow-DB writer checks.",
    "NO fabricated Home bank balance on verified SQLCipher failure; show readable placeholder instead.",
    "Bound Home transaction result list and count with stable index, keeping verified account scope and filters.",
    "Remove unsupported monthly growth % until authenticated historical balances exist.",
    "Expand bank/wallet SMS sender identification to approved catalog only; keep no unconfirmed account selection or posting.",
    "Support Other institution child accounts without conflating different banks; preserve encrypted identity or fail closed.",
    "Allow user to clear verified bank last four atomically with rename and authenticated SQLCipher writer.",
    "Add historical V24/V3 restore/reconciliation regression matrix; owner original handset verification separate.",
    "Audit retired AI helper graph and remove truly unreachable code only with preserved security regression coverage."
